# Separate scripts

Put page behavior in its own JavaScript file. Do not add inline `<script>` blocks to HTML.

## Where

- Site scripts live in `assets/`, named for the page (`assets/work.js`, `assets/analytics.js`).
- Link the file from the page. Match the path depth of that page.

```html
<script src="../assets/work.js"></script>
```

## Avoid

```html
<script>
  (function () {
    // page behavior
  })();
</script>
```
